<section class="da-section" aria-labelledby="deletion-paths-title">
  <div class="da-shell">
    <header class="da-section__heading">
      <p class="da-overline">Two secure paths</p>
      <h2 id="deletion-paths-title">Choose the option available to you</h2>
      <p>Both paths protect your account from deletion by someone who only knows your email address.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="da-paths">
      <article id="delete-in-app" class="da-path da-path--primary">
        <span class="da-step" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>Delete immediately in the Chakusa app</h3>
        <p>Sign in, open Account or Settings, then choose Delete Account. Confirm with your password, Google account, or Apple account as shown in the app.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Open Chakusa and sign in.</li>
          <li>Open Account or Settings.</li>
          <li>Select Delete Account.</li>
          <li>Review the warning and confirm your identity.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="da-path__note">Successful confirmation permanently deletes the account. An owner with active team members will be asked to resolve business ownership first.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="da-path">
        <span class="da-step" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>Request deletion from the web</h3>
        <p>Use the request form below. It prepares an email to Chakusa's privacy team, so you can start the process without the mobile app.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Enter the email used for your Chakusa account.</li>
          <li>Open the prepared request in your email app.</li>
          <li>Send it from the account email where possible.</li>
          <li>Complete the ownership verification steps in our reply.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="da-path__note">Never send your password, authentication code, payment card information, or customer data by email.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
